  "headline": "Valacyclovir hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale General has 16.4 days on hand and the top alternate is Aurobindo Pharma Limited",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "D1", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show valacyclovir hydrochloride is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 256 tablets of the 1 g presentation at a daily use of 15.6, giving 16.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule ranks Aurobindo Pharma Limited as the first alternate manufacturer; it is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Aurobindo Pharma Limited operates three plants: APL HEALTHCARE LIMITED last inspected VAI on 2025-12-17, Aurobindo Pharma Limited last inspected VAI on 2022-05-10, and Aurolife Pharma LLC last inspected OAI on 2021-12-07.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "AvPAK and Camber Pharmaceuticals, Inc. are ranked second and third but their labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for our supply names Northwind Health Company, LLC (FEI 1831143) as a repack plant with a VAI inspection on 2025-09-26.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check whether the Northwind repack plant remains suitable and confirm availability from Aurobindo Pharma Limited's plants before purchasing.",
      "cites": ["E7", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
